The '''Rabbit Godfather Shard''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Shard]] that grants the {{Attr|Egg Finder}} [[Attribute]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Fusion ===
A '''Rabbit Godfather Shard''' can be obtained through [[Fusion]], specifically [[Chameleon Fusion]] and [[Special Fusion]]. For [[Special Fusion]], the following input conditions must be met:
* First: {{Item|Rabbit Godmother Shard}}
* Second: {{Legendary}} or higher and {{Red|Combat}} Category
{{Fusion Obtaining Table}}

